From 5d6f8a09c6091ffba2a7ef65f43eb503a4ff4ca9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jerryfane <38183696+jerryfane@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 04:57:47 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] drama: support NVFP4 and reference CFG on Metal

Keep expert storage packed and retain checkpoint activation precision while
mapping original router IDs to compact expert slots. Independent backbone
states allow reference-conditioned semantic guidance without changing codec
heads or builtin-voice behavior.

On Apple M5 Ultra, the production code completed 28 HTTP checks: 15 complete
PCM replies, one early stream close and 12 expected validation refusals.
Paired and separate guidance replies matched exactly. The initial registered
operator run passed 13/14 variants and all runtime limits; the following
test-only patch corrects the remaining fixture's precision discrimination.

